# Measure twice, change nothing
# Each instrument reads the same unchanged vessel twice. The paired values are
# a control for the bench's deterministic, non-invasive measurement contract.
register lv1
add v1 water 0.40L
add v1 KNO3 0.00012mol
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 conductivity
new
add v2 water 0.55L
add v2 HCl 0.00011mol
measure v2 ph
measure v2 ph
new
add v3 water 0.33L
heat v3 330J
measure v3 temp
measure v3 temp
new
seal v4 0.42L
add v4 N2 0.0031mol
measure v4 pressure
measure v4 pressure
new
add v5 water 0.21L
measure v5 balance
measure v5 balance
# Calibration error, drift, random noise, sample consumption and probe
# disturbance are deliberately outside this deterministic instrument model.
